      ],
      "content": "SP 91 NW                   PITSTONE             CHEQUERS LANE 4/145                                           Nos. 5-7 (odd) (Sparrow Thatch) -   -                                               II House.   C17, altered and extended to left C19.  C17  part has some timber framing, now covered with colourwashed render, with post exposed to front right corner.  Thatched roof, rendered chimneys to right and between left bays.  1½ storeys, 3 bays.  3-light leaded casements, mostly C20, with additional single lights to right of outer bays.  Left window to first floor is below eaves, 2 to right are in thatch.  C20 board door in C20 porch with hipped thatch roof between right bays.  C19 extension  to left is of whitewashed render with dark tiled roof, rendered chimney to left, and barred wooden casements, one to first floor, 2 to ground floor. Interior not seen. Listing NGR: SP9336615989"
    }
  ],
